{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"java-csharp-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Java and C# Snippets","description":"Classes, methods, records, streams, LINQ, async and test snippets for Java and C#.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Java / C#","path":"snippets/java-c.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/java-c.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Java main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jmain\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public static void main(String[] args) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Java main\"\n  },\n  \"Java class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jclass\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Java class\"\n  },\n  \"Java record\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jrec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public record ${1:Name}(${2:String field}) {}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A record\"\n  },\n  \"Java stream\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jstream\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:list}.stream().filter(${2:x} -> $3).map(${2:x} -> $4).toList()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A stream pipeline\"\n  },\n  \"Java sysout\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sout\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"System.out.println(${1:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"System.out.println\"\n  },\n  \"JUnit test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"jtest\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Test\",\n      \"void ${1:works}() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A JUnit 5 test\"\n  },\n  \"Spring controller\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"spring\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@RestController\",\n      \"@RequestMapping(\\\"${1:/api}\\\")\",\n      \"public class ${2:Name}Controller {\",\n      \"\\t@GetMapping\",\n      \"\\tpublic ${3:String} ${4:get}() {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Spring REST controller\"\n  },\n  \"C# class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cclass\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A C# class\"\n  },\n  \"C# property\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prop\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public ${1:string} ${2:Name} { get; set; }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An auto property\"\n  },\n  \"C# async method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"casync\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public async Task<${1:string}> ${2:Name}Async(${3})\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async method\"\n  },\n  \"C# LINQ\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"linq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.Where(${2:x} => $3).Select(${2:x} => $4).ToList()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A LINQ query\"\n  },\n  \"C# record\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"crec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"public record ${1:Name}(${2:string Field});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A record\"\n  },\n  \"C# Console\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Console.WriteLine(${1:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Console.WriteLine\"\n  },\n  \"C# try catch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ctry\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"try\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$1\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"catch (${2:Exception} ex)\",\n      \"{\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"try / catch\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Java and C# Snippets\n\nClasses, methods, records, streams, LINQ, async and test snippets for Java and C#.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 14 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Java / C# | `jmain` | A Java main |\n| Java / C# | `jclass` | A Java class |\n| Java / C# | `jrec` | A record |\n| Java / C# | `jstream` | A stream pipeline |\n| Java / C# | `sout` | System.out.println |\n| Java / C# | `jtest` | A JUnit 5 test |\n| Java / C# | `spring` | A Spring REST controller |\n| Java / C# | `cclass` | A C# class |\n| Java / C# | `prop` | An auto property |\n| Java / C# | `casync` | An async method |\n| Java / C# | `linq` | A LINQ query |\n| Java / C# | `crec` | A record |\n| Java / C# | `cw` | Console.WriteLine |\n| Java / C# | `ctry` | try / catch |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}